Provided also that in case there is no recognized both negotiating union or negotiating council and where any dispute arises regarding choosing of the worker‘s representative to the Safety Committee, the matter may be referred to the concerned Regional Labour Commissioner (Central), who shall after hearing the parties decide the matter and his decision shall be final.
(3) The minutes of the meeting of the Safety Committee referred to in sub-rule (1) shall be recorded.
(4) Function and duties of the Safety Committee in an establishment shall include –
