G.S.R. 1449(E).—Whereas the draft of certain regulations which the Central Government proposes to make, in exercise of the powers conferred by section 57 of the Mines Act, 1952 (35 of 1952) and on the recommendations of the Committee constituted under section 12 of the said Act, were published in the Gazette of India, Extraordinary, Part II, section 3, sub-section (i), vide number G.S.R. 773 (E), dated the 20th October, 2011, as required by sub-section (1) of section 59 of the said Act, inviting objections and suggestions from all persons likely to be affected thereby on or before the expiry of a period of three months from the date of publication of the said notification in the Official Gazette;
